<title>USA: K-Swiss increases share buyback amount.</title>
<headline>K-Swiss increases share buyback amount.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>K-Swiss Inc Friday said its board of directors extended its Class A common stock repurchase program and increased the authorized amount to $10 million from $4.8 million.</p>
<p>In a statement, the athletic footwear company said its board extended the open-market program for one year to December 31, 1997.</p>
<p>Currently, there are 3,583,851 Class A common shares.</p>
</text>
